   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-33-120623-to-130723-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-33-120623-to-130723-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-33  - 12/06/23 to 13/07/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>12 June 2023 and 13 July 2023</strong>. We allocated <strong>656.497</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, using our new distribution system which boosts non-paid contributors. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/94e461c813578d09c510e1896e708ae7fa11dbb7/distribution_rounds/round-33/distribution_results/reports/round-33--general-round-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=12\" title=\":bar_chart:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">gideonro#0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">75.48091964</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Isaac (enti)<span class=\"hashtag\">#1546</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">34.44118721</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">liviade#1387</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">57.05327508</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">42.16631332</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">19.55422545</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">0xr3x</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">36.74593216</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18.74952482</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws#4246</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18.74952482</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r33pich33p</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">16.37941088</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">brichis</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15.36978214</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Marathonmind#3078</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.483715913</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">JHennyArt#2106</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.673139483</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-alig